flowchart TB
    accTitle: Request path
    accDescr: Browser traffic enters through the CDN, hits the edge worker, and is served from cache or forwarded to the origin API, which reads Postgres and a Redis cache. Analytics events fan out to a queue consumed by the warehouse loader.

    Browser([Browser]):::external

    subgraph Edge["Edge"]
        CDN[CDN] --> Worker[Edge worker]
    end

    subgraph Origin["Origin"]
        API[API service]
        DB[(Postgres)]
        Cache[(Redis)]
    end

    Browser -->|HTTPS| CDN
    Worker -->|cache miss| API
    API -->|reads and writes| DB
    API -->|session lookup| Cache
    Worker -.->|page view events| Queue[(Event queue)]
    Queue --> Loader[Warehouse loader]

